at do you mean?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"???","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"It has been set in motion since long ago. It will not stop now."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The boat suddenly surges forward at high speed. You can hear the sound of its bow cutting through the surface of the sea... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Somehow you have a feeling... you are about to be given a second chance."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOn","raw":"黑点1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]}]}
